.TH SANCHALA-CHARMAP 1 "2024" "Sanchala OS" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
sanchala-charmap \- Unicode character map and emoji picker
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B sanchala-charmap
[\fIcommand\fR] [\fIoptions\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Browse and insert Unicode characters, symbols, and emojis.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B search \fIquery\fR
Search for characters by name
.TP
.B category \fIname\fR
Browse characters by category
.TP
.B emoji
Show emoji picker
.TP
.B recent
Show recently used characters
.TP
.B copy \fIcharacter\fR
Copy character to clipboard
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
sanchala-charmap search arrow
.TP
sanchala-charmap emoji
.SH AUTHOR
Sanchala OS Team
